#: app/templates/policies/privacy.html:109
msgid ""
"Our services are not directed to children under 16. We do not knowingly "
"collect children's data. Bookings must be made by adults (18+)."
msgstr ""
"Nuestros servicios no van dirigidos a menores de 16 años. No recopilamos "
"conscientemente datos de menores. Las reservas las deben hacer adultos (18+)."

