msgid "For wire transfers, provide IBAN and account holder name"
msgstr "Para transferencias, proporciona IBAN y nombre del titular de la cuenta"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:68
msgid "We review within 2 business days and confirm eligibility"
msgstr "Revisamos en 2 días hábiles y confirmamos elegibilidad"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:69
msgid "Approved refunds processed immediately"
msgstr "Reembolsos aprobados procesados inmediatamente"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:74
msgid "Disputed Charges / Chargebacks"
msgstr "Cargos disputados / Chargebacks"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:75
msgid ""
"We strongly prefer to resolve issues directly. Chargebacks delay "
"resolution and may incur fees that we reserve the right to pass on. "
"Please contact us first."
msgstr ""
"Preferimos firmemente resolver problemas directamente. Los chargebacks "
"retrasan la resolución y pueden incurrir en comisiones que nos reservamos "
"el derecho de repercutir. Por favor, contáctanos primero."

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:79
msgid "Partial Refunds for Service Issues"
msgstr "Reembolsos parciales por problemas de servicio"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:80
msgid ""
"If a significant amenity is unavailable during your stay (e.g., AC "
"failure in summer, no hot water), contact us immediately. We will assess "
"and offer appropriate compensation (partial refund, credit, or repair)."
msgstr ""
"Si un servicio importante no está disponible durante tu estancia (ej. "
"fallo de AC en verano, sin agua caliente), contáctanos inmediatamente. "
"Evaluaremos y ofreceremos compensación adecuada (reembolso parcial, "
"crédito o reparación)."

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:84
msgid "Force Majeure"
msgstr "Fuerza mayor"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:85
msgid ""
"For events beyond our control (pandemics, natural disasters, government "
"orders), we offer:"
msgstr ""
"Para eventos fuera de nuestro control (pandemias, desastres naturales, "
"órdenes gubernamentales), ofrecemos:"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:87
msgid "Full refund of all amounts paid"
msgstr "Reembolso completo de todos los importes pagados"

#: app/templates/policies/refund.html:88
msgid "OR free rebooking for future dates (valid 12 months)"
msgstr "O reprogramación gratis para fechas futuras (válido 12 meses)"

